# Generated token sheets — `hyzer generate` / `pnpm gen:tokens` owns these
# byte for byte, and a drift test compares the committed bytes to the
# generator's output. They were formatted to match Prettier by hand until the
# system-preference @media block (specs/52) nested a declaration one level
# deeper than printWidth allows: the generator would have to model Prettier's
# wrapping to stay green, which is a worse trade than not checking output it
# fully controls. Edit the generator, never these files.
/src/lib/tokens/tokens.css
/src/lib/theme/examples/ocean.css
